# StartDance.srv  (package dance_interfaces)
#
# Called by the orchestrator on the director's schedule_start service, after the
# director has been armed. It says WHEN song t = 0 happens.
#
# Request
# Absolute time, on the ROS clock, at which song t = 0 happens (e.g. now + 5 s).
# Repeating the SAME value is acknowledged again; a different value is refused.
builtin_interfaces/Time start_time
---
# Response
# true  = every robot is scheduled for that start time
# false = nothing was scheduled; `message` says why (the orchestrator should abort)
bool success
string message